{"strongs": "H2015", "word": "הָפַךְ", "translit": "ha.phakh", "root": "המר", "morph": "H:V", "pos": "verb", "gloss": "turn, overturn", "definition": "הָפַךְ verb turn, overturn (Late Hebrew id. , Aramaic הֲפַךְ , , Arabic W SG 47 , Assyrian abâku, apâku Dl W ) — Qal Perfect Lev 13:3 + 13 t.; וְהָפַךְ consecutive 2Kgs 21:13 ; Job 34:25 3 masculine plural הָֽפְכוּ Ps 78:9 הֲפַכְתֶּם Amos 6:12 ; Jer 23:36 , etc.; Imperfect יַהֲפֹךְ Lam 3:3 ; Jer 13:23 וַיַּהֲפֹךְ Gen 19:25 + 6 t.; וַיַּהֲפָךְֿ 1Sam 10:9 suffix וַיַּהַפְכֵהוּ Judg 7:13 3 feminine singular וַתַּהֲפֹךְ 2Chr 9:12 אֶהְפֹּךְ Zeph 3:9 וַיַּהַפְכוּ 1Sam 25:12 ; Job 12:15 Imperative הֲפֹךְ 1Kgs 22:34 = 2Chr 18:33 Infinitive absolute הָפוֺךְ Prov 12:7 construct הֲפֹךְ Gen 19:29 ; 1Chr 19:3 suffix הָפְכִּי Gen 19:21 הָפְכָהּ 2Sam 10:3 — on הַפְכְּכֶם (so Baer , q. v.) Isa 29:16 , see הֶפֶךְ ; Participle active הֹפֵךְ Amos 5:8 הַהֹפְכִי Ps 114:8 plural הַהֹפְכִים Amos 5:7 passive הֲפוּכָה Hos 7:8 ; Lam 4:6 . — 1. transitive \\ \\ a. turn, turn about, turn over , with accusative: e.g. turn the back ( עֹרֶף ) Josh 7:8 ( J E ); a dish ( צַלַּחַת ) עַלפָּֿנֶיהָ 2Kgs 21:13 the hand, & so the horses of a chariot 1Kgs 22:34 = 2Chr 18:33 ; 2Kgs 9:23 but also (followed by בְּ ) of hostility Lam 3:3 turn a cake (passive) Hos 7:8 of ׳ י , שָׂפָה בְּרוּרָה ׳ ה Zeph 3:9 i.e. restore speech of a pure kind, followed by אֶלעַֿמִּים ; לֵב אַחֵר 1Sam 10:9 another heart , followed by לוֺ ; turn a wind ( רוּחַ ; i.e. bring from different quarter) Exod 10:19 ( J ). \\ \\ b. overturn, overthrow , followed by accusative Sodom, etc., Gen 19:21 ; Gen 19:25 ; Gen 19:29 ( J ), Deut 29:22 ; Jer 20:16 ; Lam 4:6 (compare ׳ מַהְפֵּכַת וגו Amos 4:11 see below; also הֲפֵכָה , [ מַהְפֵּכָה ]); city of Ammon 2Sam 10:3 = 1Chr 19:3 (object omitted); mountains Job 9:5 ; Job 28:9 throne Hag 2:22 (|| הִשְׁמִיד ), chariots v Hag 2:22 tent ( אֹהֶל ), לְמַ֫עְלָה ׳ ה Judg 7:3 object earth ( ׳ ה = devastate ) Job 12:15 wicked men Amos 4:11 ( יֲמֹרָה הָפַכְּתִּי בָּכֶם כְּמַהְפֵּכַת אֱלֹהִים אֶתסְֿדֹם וְאֶתֿ ) Prov 12:7 ; Job 34:25 (object omitted). \\ \\ c. turn = change, transform (1) followed by accusative = alter ; a colour ( עֵינוֺ ) Lev 13:55 ( P ); skin Jer 13:33 bed ( מִשְׁכָּבוֺ see ׳ מ ; Che his lying down ) Ps 41:4 i.e. restore to health; (2) pervert דִבְרֵי אֱלֹהִים Jer 23:36 (3) followed by accusative with Infinitive Ps 105:25 he turned their heart to hate his people ; (4) turn to, into , followed by two accusative Lev 13:10 ; Ps 114:8 rock into pool of water; usually followed by accusative + לְ , Ps 66:6 sea into dry land, Ps 78:44 rivers into blood, compare Ps 105:29 ; Jer 31:13 mourning into joy, so Ps 30:12 ; Amos 5:7 justice into wormwood, compare Amos 6:12 ; Amos 8:10 feasts into mourning; Deut 23:6 = Neh 13:2 curse into blessing; Amos 5:8 death-shade into morning. 2. intransitive \\ \\ a. turn, turn back , Judg 20:39 ; Judg 20:41 ; 2Kgs 5:26 ; Ps 78:9 ; 2Chr 9:12 followed by לדרך 1Sam 25:12 \\ \\ b. turn = change, change into , followed by predicate adjective לָבָן ׳ ה turn white Lev 13:3 ; Lev 13:4 ; Lev 13:13 ; Lev 13:20 (all P ). Niph`al Perfect נֶהְפַּךְ Exod 7:15 + 10 t.; נֶהְפָּ֑ךְ Job 20:14 וְנֶהְפַּךְ consecutive Lev 13:16 נֶהֶפְכָה Lam 5:2 3 masculine plural נֶהְפְּכוּ Job 19:19 + 3 t., נֶהֶפְכוּ 1Sam 4:19 ; Dan 10:16 , וְנֶהֶפְכוּ consecutive Exod 7:17 ; Isa 34:9 , etc.; Imperfect יֵהָפֵךְ Isa 60:5 ; Joel 3:4 וַיֵּהָפֵךְ Exod 14:5 ; Isa 63:10 2 masculine singular תֵּהָפֵךְ Job 30:21 ; Ezek 4:8 וַיֵּהָֽפְכוּ Exod 7:20 Infinitive absolute נַהֲפוֺךְ Esth 9:1 Participle נֶהְפָּךְ Prov 17:20 נֶהְפָּ֑כֶת Jonah 3:4 — 1. reflexive & intrans. \\ \\ a. turn oneself, turn, turn back (compare Qal 2 a ) Josh 8:20 ( J E ); turn aside Ps 78:57 turn from side to side Ezek 4:8 pains turned upon ( עַל ) her 1Sam 4:19 (i.e. came suddenly upon her) compare Dan 10:16 turn against followed by בְּ Job 19:19 turn to ( ward ), followed by עַל , Isa 60:5 (|| בא לְ ). \\ \\ b. turn = change (oneself) followed by predicate adjective Lev 13:25 ( P ); followed by predicate noun (?), vine turns into degenerate plant Jer 2:21 no predicate expressed Job 20:14 (compare v b ); of heart turned in compassion Hos 11:8 (|| נִכְמְרוּ נִחוּמָ֑י ), in sorrow, distress, Lam 1:20 of heart changed, so as to be favourably disposed toward (followed by אֶל ) Exod 14:5 ( J ) = change of mind; followed by לְ , of plague spots changing colour Lev 13:16 ; Lev 13:17 ( P ); rod changing to serpent Exod 7:15 ( P ); faces to paleness Jer 30:6 dance to mourning Lam 5:15 comeliness to corruption Dan 10:8 וַיֵּהָפֵךְ לָהֶם לְאוֺיֵב Isa 63:10 ; Job 30:21 . \\ \\ c. be perverse , only participle used substantive נֶהְפָּךְ בִּלְשׁוֺנוֺ Prov 17:20 he that is perverse with his tongue. 2. passive, \\ \\ a. be turned, turned over to followed by לְ , an inheritance to strangers Lam 5:2 . \\ \\ b. be reversed Esth 9:1 . \\ \\ c. be turned, changed , followed by לְ , waters into blood Exod 7:17 ; Exod 7:20 ( E ); Saul into another man 1Sam 10:6 streams into pitch Isa 34:9 sun to darkness Joel 3:4 stones to chaff Job 41:20 month changed from sorrow to gladness Esth 9:22 compare Ps 32:4 where complement omitted \\ \\ d. be overturned, overthrown , of city Nineveh Jonah 3:4 . \\ \\ e. be upturned , of subterran. work of miners Job 28:5 = there is an upturning. Hithpa`el Imperfect 3 feminine singular תִּתְהַפֵּךְ Job 38:14 Participle מִתְהַפֵּךְ Judg 7:13 ; Job 37:12 מִתְהַפֶּכֶת Gen 3:24 — reflexive & intransitive: 1. turn this way & that, every way , of the flaming sword Gen 3:24 ( J ); storm-cloud Job 37:12 turn over & over Judg 7:13 , of bread-cake tumbling into the host of Midian. 2. transform oneself , Job 38:14 of earth under rising dawn. Hoph`al Perfect הָהְפַּךְ עָלַי בַּלָּהוֺת Job 30:15 there have been turned upon me terrors (compare הִתְגַּלְגָּ֑לוּ v Job 30:14 , of foes).", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB2211')\">BDB2211</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H2015')\">H2015</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB2210')\">BDB2210</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB2212')\">BDB2212</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>הָפַךְ</bdbheb> <b>verb</b> <highlightword>turn, overturn</highlightword> (Late Hebrew <highlight>id.</highlight>, Aramaic <bdbarc>הֲפַךְ</bdbarc>, <placeholder1338/>, Arabic <placeholder1339/> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('W')\">W<sup>SG 47</sup></lookup>, Assyrian <transliteration><highlight>abâku, apâku</highlight></transliteration> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Dl')\">Dl<sup>W</sup></lookup>) — <div class=\"point\"><b>Qal</b> <highlight>Perfect</highlight> <ref ref=\"Lev 13:3\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(3,13,3)\">Lev 13:3</ref> + 13 t.; <bdbheb>וְהָפַךְ</bdbheb> consecutive <ref ref=\"2Kgs 21:13\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(12,21,13)\">2Kgs 21:13</ref>; <ref ref=\"Job 34:25\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"34\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"34\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(18,34,25)\">Job 34:25</ref> 3 masculine plural <bdbheb>הָֽפְכוּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 78:9\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"78\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"78\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(19,78,9)\">Ps 78:9</ref> <bdbheb>הֲפַכְתֶּם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Amos 6:12\" b=\"30\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(30,6,12)\">Amos 6:12</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 23:36\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"36\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"36\" onclick=\"bcv(24,23,36)\">Jer 23:36</ref>, etc.; <highlight>Imperfect</highlight> <bdbheb>יַהֲפֹךְ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Lam 3:3\" b=\"25\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(25,3,3)\">Lam 3:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 13:23\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(24,13,23)\">Jer 13:23</ref> <bdbheb>וַיַּהֲפֹךְ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 19:25\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(1,19,25)\">Gen 19:25</ref> + 6 t.; <bdbheb>וַיַּהֲפָךְֿ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Sam 10:9\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(9,10,9)\">1Sam 10:9</ref> suffix <bdbheb>וַיַּהַפְכֵהוּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Judg 7:13\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(7,7,13)\">Judg 7:13</ref> 3 feminine singular <bdbheb>וַתַּהֲפֹךְ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Chr 9:12\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(14,9,12)\">2Chr 9:12</ref> <bdbheb>אֶהְפֹּךְ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Zeph 3:9\" b=\"36\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(36,3,9)\">Zeph 3:9</ref> <bdbheb>וַיַּהַפְכוּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Sam 25:12\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(9,25,12)\">1Sam 25:12</ref>; <ref ref=\"Job 12:15\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(18,12,15)\">Job 12:15</ref> <highlight>Imperative</highlight> <bdbheb>הֲפֹךְ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Kgs 22:34\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"34\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"34\" onclick=\"bcv(11,22,34)\">1Kgs 22:34</ref> = <ref ref=\"2Chr 18:33\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"33\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"33\" onclick=\"bcv(14,18,33)\">2Chr 18:33</ref> <highlight>Infinitive absolute</highlight> <bdbheb>הָפוֺךְ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Prov 12:7\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(20,12,7)\">Prov 12:7</ref> <highlight>construct</highlight> <bdbheb>הֲפֹךְ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 19:29\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"29\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"29\" onclick=\"bcv(1,19,29)\">Gen 19:29</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Chr 19:3\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(13,19,3)\">1Chr 19:3</ref> suffix <bdbheb>הָפְכִּי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 19:21\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(1,19,21)\">Gen 19:21</ref> <bdbheb>הָפְכָהּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Sam 10:3\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(10,10,3)\">2Sam 10:3</ref> — on <bdbheb>הַפְכְּכֶם</bdbheb> (so <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Baer')\">Baer</lookup>, q. v.) <ref ref=\"Isa 29:16\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(23,29,16)\">Isa 29:16</ref>, see  <bdbheb><reflink>הֶפֶךְ</reflink></bdbheb>; <highlight>Participle active</highlight> <bdbheb>הֹפֵךְ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Amos 5:8\" b=\"30\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(30,5,8)\">Amos 5:8</ref> <bdbheb>הַהֹפְכִי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 114:8\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"114\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"114\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(19,114,8)\">Ps 114:8</ref> plural <bdbheb>הַהֹפְכִים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Amos 5:7\" b=\"30\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(30,5,7)\">Amos 5:7</ref> <highlight>passive</highlight> <bdbheb>הֲפוּכָה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Hos 7:8\" b=\"28\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(28,7,8)\">Hos 7:8</ref>; <ref ref=\"Lam 4:6\" b=\"25\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(25,4,6)\">Lam 4:6</ref>. — </div><div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> transitive <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>a.</b> <highlight>turn, turn about, turn over</highlight>, with accusative: e.g. turn the back (<bdbheb>עֹרֶף</bdbheb>) <ref ref=\"Josh 7:8\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(6,7,8)\">Josh 7:8</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup><lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('E')\"><reflink>E</reflink></lookup>); a dish (<bdbheb>צַלַּחַת</bdbheb>) <bdbheb>עַלפָּֿנֶיהָ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Kgs 21:13\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(12,21,13)\">2Kgs 21:13</ref> the hand, &amp; so the horses of a chariot <ref ref=\"1Kgs 22:34\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"34\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"34\" onclick=\"bcv(11,22,34)\">1Kgs 22:34</ref> = <ref ref=\"2Chr 18:33\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"33\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"33\" onclick=\"bcv(14,18,33)\">2Chr 18:33</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Kgs 9:23\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(12,9,23)\">2Kgs 9:23</ref> but also (followed by <bdbheb>בְּ</bdbheb>) of hostility <ref ref=\"Lam 3:3\" b=\"25\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(25,3,3)\">Lam 3:3</ref> turn a cake (passive) <ref ref=\"Hos 7:8\" b=\"28\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(28,7,8)\">Hos 7:8</ref> of <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>י</bdbheb>, <bdbheb>שָׂפָה בְּרוּרָה</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Zeph 3:9\" b=\"36\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(36,3,9)\">Zeph 3:9</ref> i.e. restore speech of a pure kind, followed by <bdbheb>אֶלעַֿמִּים</bdbheb>; <bdbheb>לֵב אַחֵר</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Sam 10:9\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(9,10,9)\">1Sam 10:9</ref> <highlight>another heart</highlight>, followed by <bdbheb>לוֺ</bdbheb>; turn a wind (<bdbheb>רוּחַ</bdbheb>; i.e. bring from different quarter) <ref ref=\"Exod 10:19\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(2,10,19)\">Exod 10:19</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup>). <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> <highlight>overturn, overthrow</highlight>, followed by accusative Sodom, etc., <ref ref=\"Gen 19:21\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(1,19,21)\">Gen 19:21</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 19:25\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(1,19,25)\">Gen 19:25</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 19:29\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"29\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"29\" onclick=\"bcv(1,19,29)\">Gen 19:29</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup>), <ref ref=\"Deut 29:22\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(5,29,22)\">Deut 29:22</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 20:16\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(24,20,16)\">Jer 20:16</ref>; <ref ref=\"Lam 4:6\" b=\"25\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(25,4,6)\">Lam 4:6</ref> (compare <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>מַהְפֵּכַת וגו</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Amos 4:11\" b=\"30\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(30,4,11)\">Amos 4:11</ref> see below; also <bdbheb>הֲפֵכָה</bdbheb>, [<bdbheb>מַהְפֵּכָה</bdbheb>]); city of Ammon <ref ref=\"2Sam 10:3\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(10,10,3)\">2Sam 10:3</ref> = <ref ref=\"1Chr 19:3\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(13,19,3)\">1Chr 19:3</ref> (object omitted); mountains <ref ref=\"Job 9:5\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(18,9,5)\">Job 9:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"Job 28:9\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(18,28,9)\">Job 28:9</ref> throne <ref ref=\"Hag 2:22\" b=\"37\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(37,2,22)\">Hag 2:22</ref> (|| <bdbheb>הִשְׁמִיד</bdbheb>), chariots v<ref ref=\"Hag 2:22\" b=\"37\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(37,2,22)\">Hag 2:22</ref> tent (<bdbheb>אֹהֶל</bdbheb>), <bdbheb>לְמַ֫עְלָה</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Judg 7:3\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(7,7,3)\">Judg 7:3</ref> object earth (<bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ה</bdbheb> = <highlight>devastate</highlight>) <ref ref=\"Job 12:15\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(18,12,15)\">Job 12:15</ref> wicked men <ref ref=\"Amos 4:11\" b=\"30\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(30,4,11)\">Amos 4:11</ref> (<bdbheb>יֲמֹרָה הָפַכְּתִּי בָּכֶם כְּמַהְפֵּכַת אֱלֹהִים אֶתסְֿדֹם וְאֶתֿ</bdbheb>) <ref ref=\"Prov 12:7\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(20,12,7)\">Prov 12:7</ref>; <ref ref=\"Job 34:25\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"34\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"34\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(18,34,25)\">Job 34:25</ref> (object omitted). <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>c.</b> <highlight>turn = change, transform</highlight> (1) followed by accusative = <highlight>alter</highlight>; a colour (<bdbheb>עֵינוֺ</bdbheb>) <ref ref=\"Lev 13:55\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"55\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"55\" onclick=\"bcv(3,13,55)\">Lev 13:55</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>); skin <checkingNeeded/><ref ref=\"Jer 13:33\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"33\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"33\" onclick=\"bcv(24,13,33)\">Jer 13:33</ref> bed (<bdbheb>מִשְׁכָּבוֺ</bdbheb> see <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>מ</bdbheb>; <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Che')\">Che</lookup> <highlight>his lying down</highlight>) <ref ref=\"Ps 41:4\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"41\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"41\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(19,41,4)\">Ps 41:4</ref> i.e. restore to health; (2) <highlight>pervert</highlight> <bdbheb>דִבְרֵי אֱלֹהִים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 23:36\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"36\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"36\" onclick=\"bcv(24,23,36)\">Jer 23:36</ref> (3) followed by accusative with Infinitive <ref ref=\"Ps 105:25\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"105\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"105\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(19,105,25)\">Ps 105:25</ref> <highlight>he turned their heart to hate his people</highlight>; (4) <highlight>turn to, into</highlight>, followed by two accusative <ref ref=\"Lev 13:10\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(3,13,10)\">Lev 13:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 114:8\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"114\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"114\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(19,114,8)\">Ps 114:8</ref> rock into pool of water; usually followed by accusative + <bdbheb>לְ</bdbheb>, <ref ref=\"Ps 66:6\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"66\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"66\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(19,66,6)\">Ps 66:6</ref> sea into dry land, <ref ref=\"Ps 78:44\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"78\" vBegin=\"44\" cEnd=\"78\" vEnd=\"44\" onclick=\"bcv(19,78,44)\">Ps 78:44</ref> rivers into blood, compare <ref ref=\"Ps 105:29\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"105\" vBegin=\"29\" cEnd=\"105\" vEnd=\"29\" onclick=\"bcv(19,105,29)\">Ps 105:29</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 31:13\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(24,31,13)\">Jer 31:13</ref> mourning into joy, so <ref ref=\"Ps 30:12\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(19,30,12)\">Ps 30:12</ref>; <ref ref=\"Amos 5:7\" b=\"30\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(30,5,7)\">Amos 5:7</ref> justice into wormwood, compare <ref ref=\"Amos 6:12\" b=\"30\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(30,6,12)\">Amos 6:12</ref>; <ref ref=\"Amos 8:10\" b=\"30\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(30,8,10)\">Amos 8:10</ref> feasts into mourning; <ref ref=\"Deut 23:6\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(5,23,6)\">Deut 23:6</ref> = <ref ref=\"Neh 13:2\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(16,13,2)\">Neh 13:2</ref> curse into blessing; <ref ref=\"Amos 5:8\" b=\"30\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(30,5,8)\">Amos 5:8</ref> death-shade into morning. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> <highlight>intransitive</highlight> <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>a.</b> <highlight>turn, turn back</highlight>, <ref ref=\"Judg 20:39\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"39\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"39\" onclick=\"bcv(7,20,39)\">Judg 20:39</ref>; <ref ref=\"Judg 20:41\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"41\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"41\" onclick=\"bcv(7,20,41)\">Judg 20:41</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Kgs 5:26\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"26\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"26\" onclick=\"bcv(12,5,26)\">2Kgs 5:26</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 78:9\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"78\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"78\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(19,78,9)\">Ps 78:9</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Chr 9:12\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(14,9,12)\">2Chr 9:12</ref> followed by <bdbheb>לדרך</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Sam 25:12\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(9,25,12)\">1Sam 25:12</ref> <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> <highlight>turn = change, change into</highlight>, followed by predicate adjective <bdbheb>לָבָן</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ה</bdbheb> turn white <ref ref=\"Lev 13:3\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(3,13,3)\">Lev 13:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"Lev 13:4\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(3,13,4)\">Lev 13:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"Lev 13:13\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(3,13,13)\">Lev 13:13</ref>; <ref ref=\"Lev 13:20\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(3,13,20)\">Lev 13:20</ref> (all <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>). <b>Niph`al</b> <highlight>Perfect</highlight> <bdbheb>נֶהְפַּךְ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 7:15\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(2,7,15)\">Exod 7:15</ref> + 10 t.; <bdbheb>נֶהְפָּ֑ךְ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Job 20:14\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(18,20,14)\">Job 20:14</ref> <bdbheb>וְנֶהְפַּךְ</bdbheb> consecutive <ref ref=\"Lev 13:16\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(3,13,16)\">Lev 13:16</ref> <bdbheb>נֶהֶפְכָה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Lam 5:2\" b=\"25\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(25,5,2)\">Lam 5:2</ref> 3 masculine plural <bdbheb>נֶהְפְּכוּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Job 19:19\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(18,19,19)\">Job 19:19</ref> + 3 t., <bdbheb>נֶהֶפְכוּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Sam 4:19\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(9,4,19)\">1Sam 4:19</ref>; <ref ref=\"Dan 10:16\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(27,10,16)\">Dan 10:16</ref>, <bdbheb>וְנֶהֶפְכוּ</bdbheb> consecutive <ref ref=\"Exod 7:17\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(2,7,17)\">Exod 7:17</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 34:9\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"34\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"34\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(23,34,9)\">Isa 34:9</ref>, etc.; <highlight>Imperfect</highlight> <bdbheb>יֵהָפֵךְ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 60:5\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"60\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"60\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(23,60,5)\">Isa 60:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"Joel 3:4\" b=\"29\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(29,3,4)\">Joel 3:4</ref> <bdbheb>וַיֵּהָפֵךְ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 14:5\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(2,14,5)\">Exod 14:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 63:10\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"63\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"63\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(23,63,10)\">Isa 63:10</ref> 2 masculine singular <bdbheb>תֵּהָפֵךְ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Job 30:21\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(18,30,21)\">Job 30:21</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 4:8\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(26,4,8)\">Ezek 4:8</ref> <bdbheb>וַיֵּהָֽפְכוּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 7:20\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(2,7,20)\">Exod 7:20</ref> <highlight>Infinitive absolute</highlight> <bdbheb>נַהֲפוֺךְ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Esth 9:1\" b=\"17\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(17,9,1)\">Esth 9:1</ref> <highlight>Participle</highlight> <bdbheb>נֶהְפָּךְ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Prov 17:20\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(20,17,20)\">Prov 17:20</ref> <bdbheb>נֶהְפָּ֑כֶת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jonah 3:4\" b=\"32\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(32,3,4)\">Jonah 3:4</ref> — </div><div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> reflexive &amp; intrans. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>a.</b> <highlight>turn oneself, turn, turn back</highlight> (compare <b>Qal 2 a</b>) <ref ref=\"Josh 8:20\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(6,8,20)\">Josh 8:20</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup><lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('E')\"><reflink>E</reflink></lookup>); <highlight>turn aside</highlight> <ref ref=\"Ps 78:57\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"78\" vBegin=\"57\" cEnd=\"78\" vEnd=\"57\" onclick=\"bcv(19,78,57)\">Ps 78:57</ref> <highlight>turn</highlight> from side to side <ref ref=\"Ezek 4:8\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(26,4,8)\">Ezek 4:8</ref> <highlight>pains turned upon</highlight> (<bdbheb>עַל</bdbheb>) <highlight>her</highlight> <ref ref=\"1Sam 4:19\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(9,4,19)\">1Sam 4:19</ref> (i.e. came suddenly upon her) compare <ref ref=\"Dan 10:16\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(27,10,16)\">Dan 10:16</ref> <highlight>turn against</highlight> followed by <bdbheb>בְּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Job 19:19\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(18,19,19)\">Job 19:19</ref> <highlight>turn to</highlight> (<highlight>ward</highlight>), followed by <bdbheb>עַל</bdbheb>, <ref ref=\"Isa 60:5\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"60\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"60\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(23,60,5)\">Isa 60:5</ref> (|| <bdbheb>בא לְ</bdbheb>). <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> <highlight>turn = change</highlight> (oneself) followed by predicate adjective <ref ref=\"Lev 13:25\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(3,13,25)\">Lev 13:25</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>); followed by predicate noun (?), vine turns into degenerate plant <ref ref=\"Jer 2:21\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(24,2,21)\">Jer 2:21</ref> no predicate expressed <ref ref=\"Job 20:14\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(18,20,14)\">Job 20:14</ref> (compare v<sup>b</sup>); of heart turned in compassion <ref ref=\"Hos 11:8\" b=\"28\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(28,11,8)\">Hos 11:8</ref> (|| <bdbheb>נִכְמְרוּ נִחוּמָ֑י</bdbheb>), in sorrow, distress, <ref ref=\"Lam 1:20\" b=\"25\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(25,1,20)\">Lam 1:20</ref> of heart changed, so as to be favourably disposed <highlight>toward</highlight> (followed by <bdbheb>אֶל</bdbheb>) <ref ref=\"Exod 14:5\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(2,14,5)\">Exod 14:5</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup>) = change of mind; followed by <bdbheb>לְ</bdbheb>, of plague spots changing colour <ref ref=\"Lev 13:16\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(3,13,16)\">Lev 13:16</ref>; <ref ref=\"Lev 13:17\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(3,13,17)\">Lev 13:17</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>); rod changing to serpent <ref ref=\"Exod 7:15\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(2,7,15)\">Exod 7:15</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>); faces to paleness <ref ref=\"Jer 30:6\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(24,30,6)\">Jer 30:6</ref> dance to mourning <ref ref=\"Lam 5:15\" b=\"25\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(25,5,15)\">Lam 5:15</ref> comeliness to corruption <ref ref=\"Dan 10:8\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(27,10,8)\">Dan 10:8</ref> <bdbheb>וַיֵּהָפֵךְ לָהֶם לְאוֺיֵב</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 63:10\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"63\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"63\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(23,63,10)\">Isa 63:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"Job 30:21\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(18,30,21)\">Job 30:21</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>c.</b> <highlight>be perverse</highlight>, only participle used substantive <bdbheb>נֶהְפָּךְ בִּלְשׁוֺנוֺ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Prov 17:20\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(20,17,20)\">Prov 17:20</ref> <highlight>he that is perverse with his tongue.</highlight> </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> passive, <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>a.</b> <highlight>be turned, turned over to</highlight> followed by <bdbheb>לְ</bdbheb>, an inheritance to strangers <ref ref=\"Lam 5:2\" b=\"25\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(25,5,2)\">Lam 5:2</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> <highlight>be reversed</highlight> <ref ref=\"Esth 9:1\" b=\"17\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(17,9,1)\">Esth 9:1</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>c.</b> <highlight>be turned, changed</highlight>, followed by <bdbheb>לְ</bdbheb>, waters into blood <ref ref=\"Exod 7:17\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(2,7,17)\">Exod 7:17</ref>; <ref ref=\"Exod 7:20\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(2,7,20)\">Exod 7:20</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('E')\"><reflink>E</reflink></lookup>); Saul into another man <ref ref=\"1Sam 10:6\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(9,10,6)\">1Sam 10:6</ref> streams into pitch <ref ref=\"Isa 34:9\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"34\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"34\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(23,34,9)\">Isa 34:9</ref> sun to darkness <ref ref=\"Joel 3:4\" b=\"29\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(29,3,4)\">Joel 3:4</ref> stones to chaff <ref ref=\"Job 41:20\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"41\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"41\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(18,41,20)\">Job 41:20</ref> month changed from sorrow to gladness <ref ref=\"Esth 9:22\" b=\"17\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(17,9,22)\">Esth 9:22</ref> compare <ref ref=\"Ps 32:4\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"32\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"32\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(19,32,4)\">Ps 32:4</ref> where complement omitted <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>d.</b> <highlight>be overturned, overthrown</highlight>, of city Nineveh <ref ref=\"Jonah 3:4\" b=\"32\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(32,3,4)\">Jonah 3:4</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>e.</b> <highlight>be upturned</highlight>, of subterran. work of miners <ref ref=\"Job 28:5\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(18,28,5)\">Job 28:5</ref> = <highlight>there is an upturning.</highlight> <b>Hithpa`el</b> <highlight>Imperfect</highlight> 3 feminine singular <bdbheb>תִּתְהַפֵּךְ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Job 38:14\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"38\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"38\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(18,38,14)\">Job 38:14</ref> <highlight>Participle</highlight> <bdbheb>מִתְהַפֵּךְ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Judg 7:13\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(7,7,13)\">Judg 7:13</ref>; <ref ref=\"Job 37:12\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"37\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"37\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(18,37,12)\">Job 37:12</ref> <bdbheb>מִתְהַפֶּכֶת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 3:24\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(1,3,24)\">Gen 3:24</ref> — reflexive &amp; intransitive: </div><div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> <highlight>turn this way</highlight> &amp;<highlight> that, every way</highlight>, of the flaming sword <ref ref=\"Gen 3:24\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(1,3,24)\">Gen 3:24</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup>); storm-cloud <ref ref=\"Job 37:12\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"37\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"37\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(18,37,12)\">Job 37:12</ref> <highlight>turn over &amp; over</highlight> <ref ref=\"Judg 7:13\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(7,7,13)\">Judg 7:13</ref>, of bread-cake tumbling into the host of Midian. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> <highlight>transform oneself</highlight>, <ref ref=\"Job 38:14\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"38\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"38\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(18,38,14)\">Job 38:14</ref> of earth under rising dawn. <b>Hoph`al</b> <highlight>Perfect</highlight> <bdbheb>הָהְפַּךְ עָלַי בַּלָּהוֺת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Job 30:15\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(18,30,15)\">Job 30:15</ref> <highlight>there have been turned upon me terrors</highlight> (compare <bdbheb>הִתְגַּלְגָּ֑לוּ</bdbheb> v<ref ref=\"Job 30:14\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(18,30,14)\">Job 30:14</ref>, of foes). </p></div><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "Lev 13:3", "book": "LEV", "chapter": 13, "verse": 3}, {"raw": "2Kgs 21:13", "book": "2KI", "chapter": 21, "verse": 13}, {"raw": "Job 34:25", "book": "JOB", "chapter": 34, "verse": 25}, {"raw": "Ps 78:9", "book": "PSA", "chapter": 78, "verse": 9}, {"raw": "Amos 6:12", "book": "AMO", "chapter": 6, "verse": 12}, {"raw": "Jer 23:36", "book": "JER", "chapter": 23, "verse": 36}, {"raw": "Lam 3:3", "book": "LAM", "chapter": 3, "verse": 3}, {"raw": "Jer 13:23", "book": "JER", "chapter": 13, "verse": 23}, {"raw": "Gen 19:25", "book": "GEN", "chapter": 19, "verse": 25}, {"raw": "1Sam 10:9", "book": "1SA", "chapter": 10, "verse": 9}, {"raw": "Judg 7:13", "book": "JDG", "chapter": 7, "verse": 13}, {"raw": "2Chr 9:12", "book": "2CH", "chapter": 9, "verse": 12}, {"raw": "Zeph 3:9", "book": "ZEP", "chapter": 3, "verse": 9}, {"raw": "1Sam 25:12", "book": "1SA", "chapter": 25, "verse": 12}, {"raw": "Job 12:15", "book": "JOB", "chapter": 12, "verse": 15}, {"raw": "1Kgs 22:34", "book": "1KI", "chapter": 22, "verse": 34}, {"raw": "2Chr 18:33", "book": "2CH", "chapter": 18, "verse": 33}, {"raw": "Prov 12:7", "book": "PRO", "chapter": 12, "verse": 7}, {"raw": "Gen 19:29", "book": "GEN", "chapter": 19, "verse": 29}, {"ra